# Universal Crypto MCP - Wallets

Cross-chain wallet management for Universal Crypto MCP, supporting EVM chains (Ethereum, Polygon, Base, etc.) and Solana.

## Packages

| Package | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| [@universal-crypto-mcp/wallets-shared](./shared/) | Shared interfaces, types, and utilities |
| [@universal-crypto-mcp/wallet-evm](./evm/) | EVM wallet tools (Ethereum, Polygon, Arbitrum, etc.) |
| [@universal-crypto-mcp/wallet-solana](./solana/) | Solana wallet tools |

## Installation

```bash
# Install all wallet packages
pnpm add @universal-crypto-mcp/wallet-evm @universal-crypto-mcp/wallet-solana

# Or install individually
pnpm add @universal-crypto-mcp/wallet-evm
pnpm add @universal-crypto-mcp/wallet-solana
```

## Quick Start

### EVM Wallet

```typescript
import { EVMWallet, registerAllEVMTools } from "@universal-crypto-mcp/wallet-evm";
import { McpServer } from "@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/mcp.js";

// Create wallet
const wallet = new EVMWallet({
  privateKey: "0x...",
  chainId: "eip155:1", // Ethereum mainnet
});

// Register MCP tools
const server = new McpServer({ name: "my-server" });
registerAllEVMTools(server, wallet);
```

### Solana Wallet

```typescript
import { SolanaWallet, registerAllSolanaTools } from "@universal-crypto-mcp/wallet-solana";
import { McpServer } from "@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/mcp.js";

// Create wallet
const wallet = new SolanaWallet({
  privateKey: "base58-private-key",
  network: "mainnet",
});

// Register MCP tools
const server = new McpServer({ name: "my-server" });
registerAllSolanaTools(server, wallet);
```

## Shared Interface

All wallets implement the `WalletProvider` interface from `@universal-crypto-mcp/wallets-shared`:

```typescript
interface WalletProvider {
  readonly chain: string;
  readonly address: string;
  
  // Balance
  getBalance(): Promise<Balance>;
  getTokenBalance(token: string): Promise<Balance>;
  
  // Transfers
  transfer(to: string, amount: string): Promise<TransactionResult>;
  transferToken(token: string, to: string, amount: string): Promise<TransactionResult>;
  
  // Signing
  signMessage(message: string): Promise<string>;
  signTypedData(data: TypedData): Promise<string>;
  
  // Transactions
  sendTransaction(tx: TransactionRequest): Promise<TransactionResult>;
}
```

## MCP Tools

### EVM Tools

| Tool | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `evm_get_balance` | Get native token balance |
| `evm_get_token_balance` | Get ERC20 token balance |
| `evm_get_token_info` | Get ERC20 token information |
| `evm_transfer` | Transfer native tokens |
| `evm_transfer_token` | Transfer ERC20 tokens |
| `evm_sign_message` | Sign a message (EIP-191) |
| `evm_sign_typed_data` | Sign typed data (EIP-712) |
| `evm_approve_token` | Approve token spending |
| `evm_token_allowance` | Check token allowance |
| `evm_get_nft` | Get NFT information |
| `evm_nft_balance` | Get NFT balance |
| `evm_transfer_nft` | Transfer an NFT |

### Solana Tools

| Tool | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `solana_get_balance` | Get SOL balance |
| `solana_get_token_balance` | Get SPL token balance |
| `solana_get_token_info` | Get SPL token information |
| `solana_transfer` | Transfer SOL |
| `solana_transfer_token` | Transfer SPL tokens |
| `solana_sign_message` | Sign a message |
| `solana_get_address` | Get wallet address |
| `solana_get_token_account` | Get associated token account |
| `solana_create_token_account` | Create token account |
| `solana_get_nft` | Get NFT information |
| `solana_transfer_nft` | Transfer an NFT |
| `solana_request_airdrop` | Request airdrop (devnet/testnet) |

## Security

⚠️ **IMPORTANT**: These tools handle private keys. Never expose private keys in logs, error messages, or client-side code.

- Store private keys in environment variables
- Use hardware wallets for production
- Test on testnets before mainnet
- Review all transactions before signing

